    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1818",
      "reading_order": 2333,
      "section": "2-1. Period of Home Position Setting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 70.92,
        "t": 735.974552,
        "r": 254.96736000000004,
        "b": 727.1028329281769
      },
      "content": "2-1. Period of Home Position Setting",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1819",
      "reading_order": 2334,
      "section": "2-1. Period of Home Position Setting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.29964599999997,
        "t": 724.574798,
        "r": 505.5815879999987,
        "b": 704.1830849281769
      },
      "content": "Because the absolute position detector is used as the position detection system of tool post servo, the home position setting of Tool Post should be performed in the following cases."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1820",
      "reading_order": 2335,
      "section": "2-1. Period of Home Position Setting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.45991,
        "t": 689.827442,
        "r": 385.2514079999999,
        "b": 679.276382
      },
      "content": "1 If have disassembled or reassembled the servo motor."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1821",
      "reading_order": 2336,
      "section": "2-1. Period of Home Position Setting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.46,
        "t": 678.3071600000001,
        "r": 273.014472,
        "b": 667.7561000000001
      },
      "content": "2 If exchanging the servo amp."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1822",
      "reading_order": 2337,
      "section": "2-1. Period of Home Position Setting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.46,
        "t": 666.84716,
        "r": 256.8582240000001,
        "b": 656.2961
      },
      "content": "3 If exchanging the battery."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1823",
      "reading_order": 2338,
      "section": "2-1. Period of Home Position Setting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.46,
        "t": 655.26716,
        "r": 385.88977199999977,
        "b": 644.7161
      },
      "content": "4 If disconnecting the detector connector of servo motor."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1824",
      "reading_order": 2339,
      "section": "2-2. Home Position Setting Method",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 70.92,
        "t": 629.534766,
        "r": 247.27600800000002,
        "b": 620.6630469281769
      },
      "content": "2-2. Home Position Setting Method",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1825",
      "reading_order": 2340,
      "section": "2-2. Home Position Setting Method",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.299646,
        "t": 600.91464,
        "r": 512.2218419999997,
        "b": 580.5830469281768
      },
      "content": "Check the Turret Clamp L/S status.(TURRET CLAMP L/S = \"l\") And press the \"MDI\" mode in the sheet key."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1826",
      "reading_order": 2341,
      "section": "2-2. Home Position Setting Method",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 85.14,
        "t": 542.4146599999999,
        "r": 207.42808800000003,
        "b": 499.0430789281767
      },
      "content": "Set the  KEEP RELAY PARAMETER  K5#0 =1"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1827",
      "reading_order": 2342,
      "section": "2-2. Home Position Setting Method",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 85.14,
        "t": 496.45492399999995,
        "r": 218.45209200000016,
        "b": 372.5636249281767
      },
      "content": "Unclamp the turret by simultaneously pressing[     Spindle STOP]     , [SELECT], [FEEDHOLD]   on the operating panel. The message \" 2067 TURRET COMPANY UNCLAMP\" will be display on the alarm screen."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1828",
      "reading_order": 2343,
      "section": "2-2. Home Position Setting Method",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 85.14,
        "t": 369.9754699999999,
        "r": 202.9611720000001,
        "b": 269.0640389281766
      },
      "content": "Turn the turret by hand and set the No.1 tool. Turn the turret and remain it on the position where the arrows of turret and tool post body are aligned."
    },
